{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"测试运维与持续保障","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infra-test-in-pipeline","title":"CI/CD 中的基础设施测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/infra-test-in-pipeline","wordCount":1120,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"drift-detection-reconciliation","title":"漂移检测与修复","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/drift-detection-reconciliation","wordCount":1071,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-estimation-testing","title":"成本预估与测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/cost-estimation-testing","wordCount":1113,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 测试运维与持续保障\n\n本章将基础设施测试从开发阶段延伸到持续运维：如何在 CI/CD 管道中编排测试执行、如何检测并修复部署后的配置漂移、以及如何在变更前预估成本影响。\n\n这三个主题解决的是\"测试写好了，然后呢？\"——确保测试不只是本地跑一次就遗忘，而是成为基础设施生命周期中持续运转的质量保障机制。\n"}